  "body": "## Changelog\n### New Features\n* 8321ea434bca17486eeb763e40bbf63bb1c8b324: feat(backups): capture & restore per-torrent save paths (#2067) (@s0up4200)\n* b5ccb2d87472fa56856300f83f92238461bf546e: feat(fs): respect process umask for content directory creation (#2086) (@s0up4200)\n* 256bd5ded22d6c99f43f16862f88c26a005279f6: feat(i18n): add Czech (cs) translation (#2049) (@luckylittle)\n* 219c3b3b918de1ea1268d4b21a7735dafa80ee20: feat(logs): expose log file downloads in settings (#2122) (@s0up4200)\n* 1afcb534eee6ac6a70b338d25fe8ec53182eeab1: feat(rss): show feed titles in affected feeds selector (#2115) (@pengchongfu)\n* e4f37e5387395e20897b0665b98a76ff11117353: feat(themes): sideloadable custom themes (#2070) (@s0up4200)\n### Bug Fixes\n* c4c19b9248b19c874fa553f866e36cebcfafbba3: fix(crossseed): stop season-pack double-nesting and honor hardlink dir preset (#2088) (@s0up4200)\n* 3e797f6044a0f7ce51bbe47c34c14b32e58cf70b: fix(dashboard): preserve fallback status during SSE reconnect (#2085) (@Audionut)\n* 9f6bcd697edcc7391d5699e2a31111c4cf543a7f: fix(dirscan): align injected torrent paths to on-disk layout (#2113) (@s0up4200)\n* c485c359fd1934ae9dee32b8fbfd0247283322d6: fix(qbittorrent): avoid sync cache reader convoys (#2106) (@s0up4200)\n* 9829089e734e8a88f38176a959442aa3f8e5a11c: fix(qbittorrent): keep loading when a qBittorrent instance is unresponsive (#2097) (@s0up4200)\n* 6fb70e06e05659695eac005d770501be9cb68b6c: fix(torrents): keep rename dialog scrolled to start of file name (#2111) (@s0up4200)\n* dbafc816b641b54e74ce76b8c22d82730971cc96: fix(torrents): keep renamed folders expanded in file tree (#2110) (@s0up4200)\n* 01c49acc82e16eff94148f4284264d6e9ba10935: fix(torrents): refresh scrolled-in pages after mutations (#2116) (@s0up4200)\n### Other Changes\n* 591997e5ead9a9d8ee05c985c403ab755007bc9d: chore(deps): bump postcss from 8.5.15 to 8.5.16 in /documentation in the npm group (#2098) (@dependabot[bot])\n* 38e5a63319355fefd0d9b06d6d08ecd19d8ce7fe